["جملة منفية (Negative)", "فعل مساعد + ضمير", "Mary isn't here, is she?"],
["الأمر Let's", "shall we", "Let's go, shall we?"]
],
"explanation": "الجملة المثبتة تتبع بذيل منفي، والجملة المنفية تتبع بذيل مثبت.",
"examples": "You like tea, don't you? / They haven't left, have they?"
},
{
"title": "Possessive Adjectives vs Possessive Pronouns",
"headers": ["Possessive Adjective", "Possessive Pronoun"],
"rows": [
